    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "1. Greeting expressions used in introductions\n\nHajimemashite.    How do you do? (lit., It's the first time [for me to meet you].)\nDoozo yoroshiku.  Pleased to meet you. (lit., I ask your favor [good treatment].)\n\nThese two expressions can be used just like the comparable English expressions."
